<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-theme="system">
  <head>
    <title><%= content_for(:title) || t("app.name") %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="application-name" content="<%= t("app.name") %>">
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <script data-theme-bootstrap>
      (() => {
        const key = "quitando.theme"
        const allowed = ["light", "dark"]
        const stored = localStorage.getItem(key)
        if (stored && !allowed.includes(stored)) localStorage.removeItem(key)
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = allowed.includes(stored) ? stored : "system"
      })()
    </script>
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <%= yield :metadata %>

    <%= yield :head %>



    <%# Includes all stylesheet files in app/assets/stylesheets %>
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag :app, "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="site-header__inner">
        <%= link_to t("app.name"), root_path, class: "wordmark" %>
        <%= render NavigationComponent.new(user: (current_user if user_signed_in?), pending_invitation_count: pending_invitation_count) %>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="page-shell" id="main-content">
      <% if demo_mode? %>
        <aside class="demo-banner" aria-labelledby="demo-banner-title">
          <h2 id="demo-banner-title">Ambiente compartilhado de demonstração</h2>
          <p>Este ambiente é demo-only e descartável. Todo o cenário é reiniciado integralmente a cada seis horas.</p>
          <p><strong>Contas públicas:</strong> <%= demo_public_emails.join(", ") %></p>
          <p><strong>Senha:</strong> <%= demo_public_password %></p>
          <p><strong>Próximo reset:</strong> <time datetime="<%= demo_next_reset_at.iso8601 %>"><%= l(demo_next_reset_at, format: :short) %></time>.</p>
        </aside>
      <% end %>
      <% if flash[:alert].present? %>
        <%= render AlertComponent.new(message: flash[:alert]) %>
      <% end %>
      <% if flash[:notice].present? %>
        <%= render AlertComponent.new(message: flash[:notice]) %>
      <% end %>
      <%= yield %>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
